# Nicenic WHMCS Registrar Module

This repository contains the official **WHMCS integration module** for **Nicenic.NET**, an **ICANN-accredited domain registrar**.

It allows WHMCS users to register, renew, transfer, and manage domains directly through Nicenic’s API.


### 🌐 API Endpoint
- Base URL: [https://nicenic.net/reseller/apiv2.php](https://nicenic.net/reseller/apiv2.php)  
- WHMCS Integration Link: [https://nicenic.net/reseller/apiv2.php?whmcs=1&api_type=whmcs](https://nicenic.net/reseller/apiv2.php?whmcs=1&api_type=whmcs)

### ⚙️ Features
- Domain registration, transfer, renewal  
- Contact modification & WHOIS privacy  
- DNS and nameserver management  
- Synchronization with Nicenic system  
- Multi-currency and reseller balance support

